      {
        "id": "tb-hyperparams-results",
        "moduleId": "train-validate-results",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材示例的超参数与参考结果",
        "markdown": "训练与验证：教材示例的超参数为 `devices = try_all_gpus()`、`num_epochs = 20`、`lr = 2e-4`、`wd = 5e-4`、`lr_period = 4`、`lr_decay = 0.9`。\n\n在该设置下，参考输出为 `train loss 0.668, train acc 0.761, valid acc 0.406`，吞吐约 758.4 examples/sec。这些数字是演示规模下的结果，不是比赛最终成绩。",
